    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_212_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A moment please, Mr. Malkiewicz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#4",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, Mr. McKee. Do... do you need me for something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Malkiewicz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's good to see you again. Have you gotten the letter from the Chamber?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "text": "The only spokesmen on competition duty for the duration of the Major will be us two... an arduous task, but a gallery of eyes will be trained on us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you want to continue your ascent up the ladder after you drop the 'spokesman' title, this is your greatest chance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha... even if you're joking, I'm not really into the attention. I'd rather go off and handle arena event planning and stuff...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Malkiewicz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that your particular expertise?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not exactly expertise or inability or whatever, I'm just...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Malkiewicz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're being modest again. You've adapted much faster than any of the more senior personnel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014But I have something else I needed to tell you first. I need you to know in advance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's find a lounge to talk in?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, you're the boss...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Malkiewicz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_23_G09",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it that needs such secrecy??",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Malkiewicz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I... shouldn't actually be telling you this, but Mr. Czarny left quite hastily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "text": "On each Major occasion, Kawalerielki picks three of the cities with the most rapidly developing economies to merge into the Grand Knight Territory you see now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "text": "Within the few months following each Major, non-Grand Knight Territory cities aside, the nomadic cities return within their own one-month span to their original routes, following the route engineers' plans.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Each merging of the four cities is glorious. Marvelous flows of people, seamless trade relations, as well as the chance... to deal with a few problems.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "text": "To be honest, if it weren't for how excessively enormous the Kawalerielki Alliance is in scale, how unable it is to effectively move and avoid Catastrophes, and how difficult it is to handle supply distribution and mining...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd hope to never see the disbanding of the Kawalerielki Alliance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But what I'm going to tell you today is about... mm... an unspoken rule.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Regarding...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Malkiewicz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...The Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "text": "This year, Mieszko Industrial Group has provided the Grand Knight Territory seven nomadic platforms, to rival other countries' whole cities in scale... of course, this is how it appears on the surface.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard about this from my colleagues.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Malkiewicz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The main thing we should focus on right now is Area 0. It shows up nowhere on the legal listing Mieszko Industries has given.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is a unique plate\u2014a small-scale nomadic platform, currently linked at the southwest corner, outside Plate #17.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's where...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Malkiewicz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. It's right next to the Infected shelter and treatment center.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do pardon me, Mr. Malkiewicz, but every word we're about to exchange must be on video record.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This is by regulation. No spokesperson is permitted to act in any way which would betray the General Chamber.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Malkiewicz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Malkiewicz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_23_G03",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Malkiewicz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You look pained. I understand. When I first heard of it, I felt much the same as you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just, this is too cruel...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Malkiewicz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You are now an executor of the Board of Directors, a spokesman of the General Chamber of Commerce, Malkiewicz, my good man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's a reminder, nothing more. Of course it's not an admonishment or a threat\u2014haha, Mr. Czarny always did carry that air, didn't he?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Get a grasp of it all. Know what he's told you. Do as he said.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Malkiewicz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_211_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_212_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't mean it that way, Malkiewicz. We have to help each other.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "text": "You need to chew thoroughly over what I've told you. I'm off to check on a few Knightclubs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be seeing you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman McKee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_nearllivingroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "...M\u0142ynar?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you there? M\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#4",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Aunt Zofia?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... Margaret. Why are you still at home?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't Maria say you were going to the Knights Association? That girl...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's rote procedure. It won't take much effort.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Heheh. You really have changed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it thanks to that 'Rhodes Island' place? You never were any good with the paperwork side of things before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you still remember when you'd just applied to become a knight? Independent knight Margaret Nearl, always getting her documents and processes mixed up...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. I'm lucky I had you then, Auntie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*... I understand it with Maria at least, but aren't you the same age as me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I spent so much energy getting you to call me by name. We're apart a few years and now that's undone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't have gotten strange from each other, can we? Hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Heheh, don't worry, Zofia. It's just been a long while since I've talked with family like this, face to face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "text": "Were you here looking for Uncle?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. Is he still at work?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Still not home anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You know, M\u0142ynar...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_ns_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be civil with him, and I won't blame him either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
        "text": "So don't worry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Margaret"
    },
    {
