    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... the match's about to start.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120"
    },
    {
        "text": "Same as it ever was. Turnout's ridiculous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "That Blade Helmet Knightclub sap there, didn't he show up last year too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, forget him, even their Left-hand Knight fell to Maria. What's the Blade Helmet Knightclub got?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... it was just luck, all luck. It's always embarrassing when they blow things out of proportion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh. Seems like 'Brassrust' Olmer Ingra's in this match tonight too...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha, well-acquainted, aren't you, Maria\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Learn to shut your mouth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's alright, Master Kowal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I've already given up on becoming a competition knight. It just doesn't suit me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's what I'm saying! You've got a wide world of options open to you\u2014no need to choose this or that! That's a bit of old-timer advice there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, you've made a mighty fine showing already! Cheers to you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Speaking of, we still haven't done final testing on Margaret's armor, have we?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her last suit had some decent work on it, but it still doesn't fit a Kuranta as big and brave as Margaret.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... I already started on adjustments myself. I'll need a bit more time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "And there's her weapon...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "When Margaret was new to the knight competitions, she used a warhammer. After that, she switched to a knight's longsword. Halos shone at her blade's edge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now\u2014she's on a swordspear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_101"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah! It's a Minoan beauty forged of D32 Steel. The ultimate in Originium Arts conductivity!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really takes me back. She came knocking, asking if I could change her sword out for an easier one to handle\u2014the very first time Old Nearl's granddaughter ever asked a word of me\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough nostalgia, Kowal, the Radiant Knight's down in the arena next week. Are you people even helping her?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Repeat that? You think I'm anything like you? Nothing but drink and idle hands all day?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Brassrust Knight's lined up for... capture the flag? Why's Bloodboil Knightclub squandered an elite knight on such a high-risk low-reward format...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "text": "(His opponent is... Oh, they're all small-time Knightclubs...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "(...Hold on, there's an Infected knight in this...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
