    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
        "blackstart": 0.4,
        "blackend": 0.9,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The main Major matches. Mm-hm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "When you became an Infected, did you ever picture a day like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ever picture being in this arena, winning yourself more wealth than nine lives could make?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_220"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know... I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "An Infected Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been my honor to join Pinus Sylvestris Knightclub, Wild Mane.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "An Infected Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_220",
        "name2": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
        "blackstart2": 0.4,
        "blackend2": 0.9,
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, just call me by my name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_220",
        "name2": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
        "blackstart2": 0.4,
        "blackend2": 0.9,
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine! Once I get that prize money, I'll take you for drinks, Iwona.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "An Infected Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Deal! No one ever drinks with me except Ashlock. Here I was getting bored out of my skull\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iwona"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Do you still remember the rules of capture the flag?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iwona"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_220",
        "name2": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I do. Stay inside the score lines and avoid direct clashes\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "An Infected Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_220",
        "name2": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, that's all the boilerplate Sona teaches you\u2014if you ask me, you smash those noble knights' armor to pieces, you're the champion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iwona"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyone makes for your points, you sort them out. Easy as easy comes, yeah?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iwona"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_220",
        "name2": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha, hahaha... if I can do it, yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "An Infected Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_220",
        "name2": "avg_496_wdmane_1#10",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Have a little confidence. You don't sound off proper, they won't give you any respect.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iwona"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you want others looking up at you, it's simple as dumping them on the ground, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iwona"
    },
    {
        "text": "But signs say someone's out for you, hah. Didn't Ashlock beat him bad enough?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iwona"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_220",
        "name2": "avg_496_wdmane_1#10",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Olmer Ingra... is he only here to knock Infected heads?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "An Infected Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "He sure has a narrow mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "An Infected Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_220",
        "name2": "avg_496_wdmane_1#9",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Kid nobles, pteh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iwona"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like the Ashlock thing hurt his self-esteem some. Puffed up bags of hot air don't even deserve to stand in the arena.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iwona"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_220",
        "name2": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh\u2014man, I'm scrapping. Maybe I should find a chance to beat him up in private.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iwona"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_220",
        "name2": "avg_496_wdmane_1#8",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "An Infected Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_104",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brassrust Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_220",
        "name2": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Now\u2014will the knights please enter the arena\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "A Voice on the PA"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_220",
        "name2": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Gettem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iwona"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_220",
        "name2": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "An Infected Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_220"
    },
    {
        "text": "The kids are still waiting for us to get back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "An Infected Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_104",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Gahah. Pinus Sylvestris...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brassrust Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Infected, a living scourge... dares to call itselves knights?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brassrust Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "To Hell with you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brassrust Knight"
    },
